keel-overlay-installer (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First release (handbook decision 0041, first implementation, step 2).
    Depends on Keel's inithooks 2.3.6+keel14, confconsole 2.2.3+keel8 and
    keel 0.12.0, the first keel that reads manifest_version 1; ships the
    overlay manifest of docs/manifest-v1.md as
    /usr/share/keel/overlays/installer.yaml, whose first boot hooks
    00declarative, 75keel-role and 80keel-cloud are inithooks' and
    10keel-system is keel's.

